            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.0.12</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Choose Live dictation to type as you speak, or insert text after releasing the hotkey.</li>
  <li>Choose GPU or Neural Engine for speech recognition.</li>
  <li>Reduced wait for your first dictation result and for Live dictation to finish after a pause.</li>
</ul>
